{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pawfee Bean",
    "steam_appid": 3683680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/88fcebccb351adbb2996bc01e2a5bea5.avif?t=1748037051\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span><u><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy cat caf\u00e9s? In the world of <i>Pawfee Bean,</i> experience work life as a cat while running your own evening caf\u00e9!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FEATURES</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Paws on Deck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be your own boss, or sit back and relax while you let your friends do all the work!</strong> Create your own lobby, and choose between a solo-play or online co-op experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Meow</strong></i><strong> Hiring!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Need a helping paw?</strong> Create a personalized caf\u00e9 code, invite fellow cats to your caf\u00e9, and put them to work!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft the <i>Purr</i>fect <i>Cat</i>mosphere!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your inner decorator!</strong> Rearrange your furniture and decorations to cook up an efficient workplace or a homely atmosphere! The choice is yours\u2026 as long as customers can\u2019t get in the way! ;3</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A <i>Knead</i> to <i>Purr</i>pare!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freshly baked goods every day!</strong> Play minigames to bake goods and prepare your caf\u00e9 before opening up for the evening!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/692727f16d72aa2f29b278121274933d.poster.avif?t=1748037051\" width=500 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/692727f16d72aa2f29b278121274933d.webm?t=1748037051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/692727f16d72aa2f29b278121274933d.mp4?t=1748037051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cater to Every <i>Whisker</i> and Whim!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hospitality is a key component to running a cozy caf\u00e9!</strong> During open hours, run around, take customers\u2019 orders, and give \u2018em what they want! Thankfully, they all seem to have incredible patience\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/7f8de371962d95e479ee13854d33f3d3.poster.avif?t=1748037051\" width=500 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/7f8de371962d95e479ee13854d33f3d3.webm?t=1748037051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/7f8de371962d95e479ee13854d33f3d3.mp4?t=1748037051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let Your Cat Out of the Bag!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stand out from the rest of the cats in town!</strong> As you work, discover different ways to stylize your cat to your own personal liking! Unlock unique cosmetics as you gain more experience working in caf\u00e9s!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/88fcebccb351adbb2996bc01e2a5bea5.avif?t=1748037051\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span><u><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy cat caf\u00e9s? In the world of <i>Pawfee Bean,</i> experience work life as a cat while running your own evening caf\u00e9!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FEATURES</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Paws on Deck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be your own boss, or sit back and relax while you let your friends do all the work!</strong> Create your own lobby, and choose between a solo-play or online co-op experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Meow</strong></i><strong> Hiring!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Need a helping paw?</strong> Create a personalized caf\u00e9 code, invite fellow cats to your caf\u00e9, and put them to work!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft the <i>Purr</i>fect <i>Cat</i>mosphere!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your inner decorator!</strong> Rearrange your furniture and decorations to cook up an efficient workplace or a homely atmosphere! The choice is yours\u2026 as long as customers can\u2019t get in the way! ;3</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A <i>Knead</i> to <i>Purr</i>pare!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freshly baked goods every day!</strong> Play minigames to bake goods and prepare your caf\u00e9 before opening up for the evening!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/692727f16d72aa2f29b278121274933d.poster.avif?t=1748037051\" width=500 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/692727f16d72aa2f29b278121274933d.webm?t=1748037051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/692727f16d72aa2f29b278121274933d.mp4?t=1748037051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cater to Every <i>Whisker</i> and Whim!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hospitality is a key component to running a cozy caf\u00e9!</strong> During open hours, run around, take customers\u2019 orders, and give \u2018em what they want! Thankfully, they all seem to have incredible patience\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/7f8de371962d95e479ee13854d33f3d3.poster.avif?t=1748037051\" width=500 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/7f8de371962d95e479ee13854d33f3d3.webm?t=1748037051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683680/extras/7f8de371962d95e479ee13854d33f3d3.mp4?t=1748037051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let Your Cat Out of the Bag!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stand out from the rest of the cats in town!</strong> As you work, discover different ways to stylize your cat to your own personal liking! Unlock unique cosmetics as you gain more experience working in caf\u00e9s!</p>",
    "short_description": "Do you love cats? How about coffee? Pawfee Bean lets you experience the laid-back work life of a cat running their very own evening caf\u00e9! Tailor your dream caf\u00e9 either alone or with up to 4 players! The purrfect pastime to spend with fellow felines and a warm cup of Pawfee!",
